WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.450
Manon recovers after light Dégagé knocks Ryu down.

2
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:00.750
Raw Drive Rush closes the gap during Ryu’s recovery.

3
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.650
Rush crouching medium kick connects as Ryu wakes up.

4
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:03.150
Back heavy punch follows the connected low.

5
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.800
Medium Renversé finishes the wake-up confirm and builds a medal.
